<title>USA: Questron Technology Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Questron Technology Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the three months ended March 31,</p>
<p>					   1997	     1996</p>
<p>Revenue:</p>
<p>  Sales			  $ 3,896,764    $ 2,767,137</p>
<p>  Fee income			  15,513	   51,363</p>
<p>				     3,912,277	2,818,500</p>
<p> Operating income		  418,013	  217,387</p>
<p> Interest expense		   60,209	   79,160</p>
<p> Income before income taxes    357,804	  138,227</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes     32,750	   20,953</p>
<p> Net income			  325,054	  117,274</p>
<p>Net income per</p>
<p>  common share			   .17		.08</p>
<p>Average number of common</p>
<p>shares and common share</p>
<p>  equivalents outstanding    1,968,091	1,541,039</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 earnings include the results of Webb Distribution Inc, which was acquired in March.</p>
<p>Full name is Questron Technology Inc.</p>
</text>
